{"id":"wb-8-166","name":"玛纳斯古城遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"玛纳斯古城遗址","text":"玛纳斯古城遗址，又称楼南古城、唐城，当地俗称破城子，位于中华人民共和国新疆维吾尔自治区昌吉回族自治州玛纳斯县，是唐代庭州西部等级最高的城址。玛纳斯古城遗址或为唐乌宰守捉，也可能是也可能是级别更高的清海军军城，城址面积约29万平方米。2019年，玛纳斯古城遗址入选第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%8E%9B%E7%BA%B3%E6%96%AF%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":93681201,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93681201","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0810cb2aebd68cb4270545db.jpg","title":"玛纳斯古城烽燧2.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%8E%9B%E7%BA%B3%E6%96%AF%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E7%83%BD%E7%87%A72.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b6/%E7%8E%9B%E7%BA%B3%E6%96%AF%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E7%83%BD%E7%87%A72.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​玛纳斯古城烽燧2","width":320,"height":240}}